# ===========================================================================
# DotAHK — .gitignore
# .NET 8 / WinUI 3 / Windows desktop application
# ===========================================================================

## Build output -------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/

## Build logs ---------------------------------------------------------------
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.log
*.binlog

## Visual Studio / IDE ------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user

## Visual Studio Code -------------------------------------------------------
# Keep shareable workspace configuration; ignore only local/machine state.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json

## Test / coverage output ---------------------------------------------------
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## NuGet --------------------------------------------------------------------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json

## MSIX / packaging output --------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: Properties/PublishProfiles/*.pubxml are committed source and are
# intentionally NOT ignored (the build selects them by platform).
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.msix
*.msixupload
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
publish/
PublishScripts/

## DotAHK local application data -------------------------------------------
# Written at runtime under %LOCALAPPDATA%\DotAHK (user settings + diagnostics).
settings.json
startup.log

## Operating system artifacts -----------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

## Other tooling ------------------------------------------------------------
_ReSharper*/
*.dotCover
.idea/
Generated Files/
*_wpftmp.csproj
